<title>JAPAN: Japan Dec palladium imports off 29.2 pct yr/yr-MOF. [CORRECTED 01:45 GMT 25/2]</title>
<headline>Japan Dec palladium imports off 29.2 pct yr/yr-MOF. [CORRECTED 01:45 GMT 25/2]</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's palladium imports in December were down 29.2 percent from a year earlier, according to Finance Ministry data released on Monday.</p>
<p>The figures were as follows (in kg):</p>
<p>		    Dec 96	Nov 96	 Dec 95</p>
<p>(Corrects months from Nov 96, Oct 96 and Nov 95 respectively)</p>
<p> Total	    5,096	 6,060	  7,196</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Russia	   2,742	 4,026	  4,136</p>
<p> South Africa   1,121	 1,431	  1,380</p>
<p>Imports in 1996 were 77.41 tonnes, up from 72.58 tonnes in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
